{"id":"wb-7-632","name":"汉代长沙王陵墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汉代长沙王陵墓群","text":"汉代长沙王陵墓群南起自长沙市岳麓区天马山，北至长沙市望城区风盘岭，沿湘江西岸的丘陵地带狭长分布，面积达30平方公里。截至2023年6月，该墓群内发现了长沙王以及王室成员墓葬25座。\n2013年王陵墓群被公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。保护范围主要分为戴公庙、谷山、王陵公园、渔阳墓和天马山片区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E4%BB%A3%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E7%8E%8B%E9%99%B5%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86494288,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86494288","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f6a45166cab65b56ae7d01ba.jpg","title":"Mausoleum_of_Wu_Zhu.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mausoleum_of_Wu_Zhu.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/Mausoleum_of_Wu_Zhu.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Mausoleum of Wu Zhu, Jingwang of Changsha","width":320,"height":240}}